        "b1_27432": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Two complete formulas.</strong></p><p>Not two single-ingredient products with a marketing story wrapped around them. Two formulas where every ingredient has a specific role, a specific dose, and a reason to be there. Complete Collagen: 10 research-backed ingredients for your skin, hair, and nails, 10,500mg of OmniCol™ hydrolysed collagen peptides per sachet, with the full co-factor stack your body needs to actually use them. Thrive Protein: 7 research-backed ingredients for your body, 22g+ of protein, 1,500mg of OmniCol™ hydrolysed collagen peptides, digestive enzymes, and a botanical complex in one sachet.</p><p><strong>EU-manufactured.</strong></p><p>Both products are made in Europe to the highest quality standards, in GMP and IFS certified facilities. Not assembled, not repackaged, not white-labelled. Manufactured from raw materials in a facility that holds the certifications we would want to see if we were the ones buying.</p><p><strong>Halal from the start.</strong></p><p>Halal certification is not something we added at the end. It was a condition before the first ingredient was sourced. At the raw material level, at the manufacturing level, at the finished product level. For our customers, this is not a feature. It is the baseline.</p><p><strong>Independently tested.</strong></p><p>Every batch is tested at a Eurofins laboratory, one of the world’s largest independent testing networks. Heavy metals, microbiological safety, nutritional content. The results are documented in a Certificate of Analysis which can be provided upon request.</p><p><strong>Designed to belong on your counter.</strong></p><p>Most supplements are designed to be stored out of sight. We designed Lumeia to sit on your kitchen counter, next to your coffee and your skincare. Every detail was built to feel premium enough that you do not hide it in a drawer.</p><p><strong>Tried before it had a name.</strong></p><p>Before the packaging, before the website, women close to us tried the formulas in plain sachets with no branding. They kept asking for more. Some told us their dermatologists noticed a difference in their skin. Others said they felt stronger and had more energy through the day.</p>",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_shape_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "type_preset": "rte",
